{"id":"fcfe6f023ac58abf","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-strong-kleene.md","title":"强Kleene三值逻辑","display":"df-strong-kleene — 强Kleene三值逻辑","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-strong-kleene","aliases":["91-df-strong-kleene","91-df-SK-logic"],"display":"df-strong-kleene — 强Kleene三值逻辑","depends_on":["[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-strong-kleene"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-strong-kleene</span><span>91-df-SK-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strong-kleene — 强Kleene三值逻辑"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-strong-kleene-—-强Kleene三值逻辑-$\\mathrm{SK}_3$\">df-strong-kleene — 强Kleene三值逻辑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SK}_3\">\\(\\mathrm{SK}_3\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> (带真理谓词的语言)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 3\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf t\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathbf f&lt;_{t}\\mathbf u&lt;_{t}\\mathbf t,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf 3\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf t\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathbf f&lt;_{t}\\mathbf u&lt;_{t}\\mathbf t,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\mathbf t=\\mathbf f,\\quad\n\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\mathbf f=\\mathbf t,\\quad\n\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\mathbf u=\\mathbf u,qquad\na\\land_{\\mathrm{SK}}b=\\min_{&lt;_{t}}\\{a,b\\},\\quad\na\\lor_{\\mathrm{SK}}b=\\max_{&lt;_{t}}\\{a,b\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\mathbf t=\\mathbf f,\\quad\n\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\mathbf f=\\mathbf t,\\quad\n\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\mathbf u=\\mathbf u,qquad\na\\land_{\\mathrm{SK}}b=\\min_{&lt;_{t}}\\{a,b\\},\\quad\na\\lor_{\\mathrm{SK}}b=\\max_{&lt;_{t}}\\{a,b\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong\\text{-}kleene}\\vdash\\mathrm{SK}_3(v)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\nv:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\begin{cases}\nv(\\neg\\varphi)=\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}v(\\varphi),\\\\\nv(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=v(\\varphi)\\land_{\\mathrm{SK}}v(\\psi),\\\\\nv(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)=v(\\varphi)\\lor_{\\mathrm{SK}}v(\\psi),\n\\end{cases}\n\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\nv(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)=\n\\inf_{&lt;_{t}}\\{v(\\varphi(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\right.\n\\\\[-1mm]\n&amp;\\hspace{47mm}\\left.\n{}\\land\nv(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)=\n\\sup_{&lt;_{t}}\\{v(\\varphi(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\right],\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong\\text{-}kleene}\\vdash\\mathrm{SK}_3(v)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\nv:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\begin{cases}\nv(\\neg\\varphi)=\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}v(\\varphi),\\\\\nv(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=v(\\varphi)\\land_{\\mathrm{SK}}v(\\psi),\\\\\nv(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)=v(\\varphi)\\lor_{\\mathrm{SK}}v(\\psi),\n\\end{cases}\n\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\nv(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)=\n\\inf_{&lt;_{t}}\\{v(\\varphi(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\right.\n\\\\[-1mm]\n&amp;\\hspace{47mm}\\left.\n{}\\land\nv(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)=\n\\sup_{&lt;_{t}}\\{v(\\varphi(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\right],\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SK}_3\">\\(\\mathrm{SK}_3\\)</span> : 强Kleene三值逻辑</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{t}, \\mathbf{f}, \\mathbf{u}\">\\(\\mathbf{t}, \\mathbf{f}, \\mathbf{u}\\)</span> : 三值真值（真、假、未定义）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> : 三值赋值函数</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：强Kleene三值逻辑是处理自指真理的核心逻辑框架：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>三值系统</strong>：真值包括<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{t}\">\\(\\mathbf{t}\\)</span>（真）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{f}\">\\(\\mathbf{f}\\)</span>（假）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{u}\">\\(\\mathbf{u}\\)</span>（未定义）</li>\n<li><strong>信息敏感</strong>：只要能确定真/假，就返回确定值</li>\n<li><strong>否定交换</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathbf{t}=\\mathbf{f}, \\neg\\mathbf{f}=\\mathbf{t}, \\neg\\mathbf{u}=\\mathbf{u}\">\\(\\neg\\mathbf{t}=\\mathbf{f}, \\neg\\mathbf{f}=\\mathbf{t}, \\neg\\mathbf{u}=\\mathbf{u}\\)</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p>强Kleene真值表：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\land \\psi\">\\(\\varphi \\land \\psi\\)</span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\lor \\psi\">\\(\\varphi \\lor \\psi\\)</span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{t}\">\\(\\mathbf{t}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{t}\">\\(\\mathbf{t}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{t}\">\\(\\mathbf{t}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{t}\">\\(\\mathbf{t}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{t}\">\\(\\mathbf{t}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{f}\">\\(\\mathbf{f}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{f}\">\\(\\mathbf{f}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{t}\">\\(\\mathbf{t}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{t}\">\\(\\mathbf{t}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{u}\">\\(\\mathbf{u}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{u}\">\\(\\mathbf{u}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{t}\">\\(\\mathbf{t}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{f}\">\\(\\mathbf{f}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{t}\">\\(\\mathbf{t}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{f}\">\\(\\mathbf{f}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{t}\">\\(\\mathbf{t}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{f}\">\\(\\mathbf{f}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{f}\">\\(\\mathbf{f}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{f}\">\\(\\mathbf{f}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{f}\">\\(\\mathbf{f}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{f}\">\\(\\mathbf{f}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{u}\">\\(\\mathbf{u}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{f}\">\\(\\mathbf{f}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{u}\">\\(\\mathbf{u}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{u}\">\\(\\mathbf{u}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{t}\">\\(\\mathbf{t}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{u}\">\\(\\mathbf{u}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{t}\">\\(\\mathbf{t}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{u}\">\\(\\mathbf{u}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{f}\">\\(\\mathbf{f}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{f}\">\\(\\mathbf{f}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{u}\">\\(\\mathbf{u}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{u}\">\\(\\mathbf{u}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{u}\">\\(\\mathbf{u}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{u}\">\\(\\mathbf{u}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{u}\">\\(\\mathbf{u}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>与弱Kleene逻辑的区别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>强Kleene</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{f} \\land \\mathbf{u} = \\mathbf{f}\">\\(\\mathbf{f} \\land \\mathbf{u} = \\mathbf{f}\\)</span>（只要能确定假，就返回假）</li>\n<li><strong>弱Kleene</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{f} \\land \\mathbf{u} = \\mathbf{u}\">\\(\\mathbf{f} \\land \\mathbf{u} = \\mathbf{u}\\)</span>（任何未定义成分导致未定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>强 Kleene 语义是 Kripke 固定点构造以及 KF 预期模型的标准三值框架；VF 通常与超赋值式语义相关，二者不应混同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-strong-kleene-—-强Kleene三值逻辑-$\\mathrm{SK}_3$","text":"df-strong-kleene — 强Kleene三值逻辑 $\\mathrm{SK}_3$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{SK}_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf 3\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf t\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathbf f<_{t}\\mathbf u<_{t}\\mathbf t,","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\mathbf t=\\mathbf f,\\quad\n\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\mathbf f=\\mathbf t,\\quad\n\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\mathbf u=\\mathbf u,qquad\na\\land_{\\mathrm{SK}}b=\\min_{<_{t}}\\{a,b\\},\\quad\na\\lor_{\\mathrm{SK}}b=\\max_{<_{t}}\\{a,b\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong\\text{-}kleene}\\vdash\\mathrm{SK}_3(v)\\coloneqq{}&\nv:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\begin{cases}\nv(\\neg\\varphi)=\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}v(\\varphi),\\\\\nv(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=v(\\varphi)\\land_{\\mathrm{SK}}v(\\psi),\\\\\nv(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)=v(\\varphi)\\lor_{\\mathrm{SK}}v(\\psi),\n\\end{cases}\n\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\nv(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)=\n\\inf_{<_{t}}\\{v(\\varphi(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\right.\n\\\\[-1mm]\n&\\hspace{47mm}\\left.\n{}\\land\nv(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)=\n\\sup_{<_{t}}\\{v(\\varphi(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mat